  "summary": "男命顺行论述说丁丑至丁卯三限轮见太阴或天同化禄与禄存吉辅命宫；丙寅羊陀夹忌、戊辰天机化忌因先天强旺仅主辛劳。庚午天同忌冲大限并与太阳忌夹先天命，但禄存、太阳禄及武曲权增旺，作者仍须谨慎。己巳句被图打断不补。",
  "summary_en": "The male forward-cycle discussion says Tai Yin OR Tian Tong Hua Lu, together with Lu Cun, support the Life Palace across Ding Chou through Ding Mao. Strong natal support is said to limit Bing Yin Yang Tuo Jia Ji and Wu Chen Tian Ji Hua Ji to toil. In Geng Wu, Tian Tong Hua Ji affects the cycle palace and joins Tai Yang Hua Ji in flanking the natal Life Palace, but Lu Cun, Tai Yang Hua Lu and Wu Qu Hua Quan provide support; caution remains necessary. The interrupted Ji Si statement is not completed.",
